    "faq": {
      "placeOrderQ": "How do I place an order?",
      "placeOrderA": "Browse the shop, add items to your cart and open your cart from the header. Proceed to checkout, fill in your delivery address and choose Cash on Delivery or UPI. You will receive an email confirmation once the order is placed.",
      "trackOrderQ": "How do I track my order?",
      "trackOrderA": "Use the Track Order page with your order number and the email used at checkout. Once your order ships, tracking details are shown on the order page as well.",
      "cancelOrderQ": "How do I cancel an order?",
      "cancelOrderA": "Orders can be cancelled from My Orders while they are still being processed (before they are packed or shipped). After dispatch, the return process applies instead.",
      "returnsQ": "What is the return and refund policy?",
      "returnsA": "You may request a return within 7 days of delivery if the item is unused, undamaged and in its original packaging. Approved refunds are processed within 5–7 business days; UPI refunds go back to the original UPI ID.",
      "paymentsQ": "Which payment methods are supported?",
      "paymentsA": "We support Cash on Delivery and UPI (scan the QR shown at checkout and submit the transaction reference). Card and net-banking options are not offered at the moment.",
      "deliveryQ": "What are the delivery timelines and charges?",
      "deliveryA": "Orders are usually dispatched within 1–2 business days and take 3–7 business days for most PIN codes. Shipping is free above ₹999; below that a flat ₹79 shipping fee applies."
    }
